          <caption>
            <p>Lateral Knee Showing Lipohemarthrosis, Radiograph. This image is a horizontal cross-table lateral view plain radiograph of the knee, showing a fat-fluid level in the suprapatellar recess, compatible with lipohemarthrosis. Contributed by A Cardenas, MD</p>
          </caption>
          <graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="Figure__1" position="float" orientation="portrait"/>
